      data normal from to compass clino tape
      48	49	120:10	+11:20	0.95						# 49
      data normal from to compass clino tape up down left right
      49	50	111:00	+74:00	0.76	1.5	1.5	.9	.9		# 50 drillmark 1.5m up on base of big stal column
      mark 50 fixed									# 50 drillmark 1.5m up on base of big stal column. Found 12-11-2011
	  station 50 "WS50 drillmark 1.5m up on base of big stal column" continuation attr Code "fixed" attr Name "WS50"
      50	51	036:00	+25:30	5.15	3.0	.6	1.3	.3		# 51 on top of wall
      51	52	025:00	+10:00	2.25	3.0	0	03	03		# 52 Foot of flow on tip 3' under tip is connection mousehole

