      flags duplicate
													      # 50 See above
      50	53	284:00	-47:00	1.28						# 53 Inlet Chamber
      data normal from to compass clino tape up down left right
      53	54	136:00	-13:30	2.94	.6	.05	.3	.5		# 54 on floor in low point of ex-wriggle
      54	55	132:00	+5:00	9.28	1	1	.7	.8		# 55 2m beyond start of tip, 3-4m beyond removed boss
      55	56	124:30	-1:00	4.60	.6	1	.1	1		# 56 by tip.  1.5m beyond start of "terminal" stal flow.
      56	57	156:30	-8:10	1.73	.5	.6	.6	.8		# 57 end of tip
      57	58	137:00	-12:40	4.27	.8	.1	.5	0		# 58 1m beyond end of flow, 03m below old ooze floor.  Aven 3m high is 1m beyond station
